# Patterns for `yadm encrypt`. This file does nothing until you run that
# command. See .config/docs/YADM.md.
#
# .ssh/config is deliberately absent: it is tracked in plaintext and holds only
# generic GitHub settings. Put machine-specific hosts in ~/.ssh/config.local.
.ssh/id_ed25519
.ssh/id_ed25519-2
.ssh/id_rsa
.gnupg/*.gpg
